ause we get interested in other  issues I'm grateful to the witnesses for  your time I think the senators on both  sides of the aisle for really careful  insightful and courteous questioning the  hearing record will remain open for 10  days members may submit additional  information within that time if they  would like thank you for being here the  committee will stand adjourned
 

